      "instructions": "Riptide publishes a paper-only, committed risk-control record plus a read-only Event Intelligence LABS snapshot. Use these tools to inspect its latest recorded allocation, performance, defensive coverage, and methodology. A public request never computes a fresh signal, writes a ledger, or places an order. Treat unavailable as unavailable and repeat the paper-only/not-investment-advice boundary when presenting results. Event-market prices are published crowd quotes, not Riptide forecasts or bets. Source rights, jurisdiction, and quote freshness fail closed; the current policy may return an intentional quarantine with zero provider events."
